WEBVTT

00:14.630 --> 00:19.600
The sweet whispers of love only happen twice.

00:20.830 --> 00:25.970
Before you know it, you're taken prisoner. Chocolat à la folie.

00:27.470 --> 00:32.390
The stardust of dawn is inlaid in the sky.

00:33.850 --> 00:38.820
My emerald eyes have you in their sights!

00:40.250 --> 00:45.030
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Choco Rune!

00:46.630 --> 00:51.470
The sparkling hearts are secret jewels.

00:52.950 --> 00:58.220
Even if the boys bully you,

00:59.370 --> 01:04.370
They've just fallen in love. Chocolat à la folie.

01:05.880 --> 01:10.860
They're really in love with you. Chocolat à la folie.

01:23.390 --> 01:25.200
Chocolat à la folie.

01:31.980 --> 01:35.010
Okay, I cooked breakfast for everyone!

01:35.410 --> 01:40.520
Cheesecake, cheese brule, cheese
cream puffs, and cheese souffle.

01:40.520 --> 01:42.740
Wow! Looks gorgeous!

01:43.020 --> 01:45.060
Really. Looks tasty.

01:45.060 --> 01:46.660
Blanca, what's going on?

01:46.660 --> 01:48.130
Wow, what a feast!

01:48.630 --> 01:50.530
Really, what gives?

01:50.530 --> 01:54.970
You're always so busy primping
your face, you've never cooked.

01:56.000 --> 02:00.840
How rude! Thinking I'm unable to cook!

02:01.570 --> 02:03.430
But why all the cheese?

02:03.680 --> 02:06.640
Because cheese is very good for health and beauty.

02:07.050 --> 02:09.810
I made all these things for Vanilla-chama
from the warmth in my heart.

02:10.120 --> 02:12.070
So hurry up and get eating!

02:12.320 --> 02:14.020
Th...thank you.

02:14.020 --> 02:16.990
Okay, which one am I gonna try first?

02:20.830 --> 02:22.530
Hate to admit it, but it's yummy!

02:24.600 --> 02:27.600
Even an unsophisticated girl like Chocolat can tell?

02:28.130 --> 02:30.930
That cake is make of ricotta cheese.

02:32.400 --> 02:36.610
Oh yes! How does pasta with cheese
sauce sound for later?

02:36.610 --> 02:39.540
I can also do cheese omelettes
and cheese fondue, too.

02:40.580 --> 02:41.910
Let's eat a ton!

02:41.910 --> 02:43.150
Bon appetit!

02:44.620 --> 02:46.560
Whoa—YUM! Amazingly good!

02:46.780 --> 02:49.990
But really, what's with all the cheese all of a sudden?

02:47.120 --> 02:48.690
It's really good!

02:48.690 --> 02:51.210
I haven't even gotten started!

02:57.300 --> 02:58.150
That's...

02:58.400 --> 02:59.160
Blanca.

03:19.150 --> 03:19.880
Welcome.

03:20.190 --> 03:22.340
G...good afternoon.

03:28.030 --> 03:30.260
Wh...what's goin on?

03:33.900 --> 03:36.730
What the heck's Blanca doin' in there?

03:37.800 --> 03:38.500
Can't be.

03:40.940 --> 03:42.840
No way. An orange heart?

03:43.310 --> 03:47.340
For someone from the Magic World to have
feelings for a human is totally forbidden.

03:48.110 --> 03:49.810
Blanca's...in love?

03:52.350 --> 03:55.120
Familiar Blanca's Bite-Sized Love

03:57.320 --> 03:58.360
Thank you for waiting.

03:59.320 --> 04:00.760
Thank you.

04:01.260 --> 04:01.560
Huh?

04:02.760 --> 04:03.690
That's a customer, isn't it?

04:07.200 --> 04:08.060
Chocolat!

04:08.970 --> 04:09.700
Miss?

04:11.440 --> 04:14.440
No need to stay outside. Please,
you're welcome to come inside.

04:18.780 --> 04:20.690
What the hell's that for?

04:20.850 --> 04:23.150
What's this? No way, Blanca!

04:23.150 --> 04:24.080
Shopping?

04:24.680 --> 04:27.080
Ah? Are you two friends?

04:27.420 --> 04:27.920
Yup.

04:27.920 --> 04:31.490
Not at all! I'm not friends with this girl!

04:32.320 --> 04:33.990
What the hell's with the cold shoulder?!

04:37.100 --> 04:38.660
You two girls are such cut-ups.

04:39.130 --> 04:41.500
My name's Tanokiirai Yoshiyuki.

04:42.170 --> 04:43.100
It's a pleasure to meet you.

04:43.530 --> 04:47.570
Uh...uhm, I'm called Blanca. Nice to meet-chu.

04:47.570 --> 04:49.180
And I'm Chocolat! Nice to meetcha.

04:59.620 --> 05:01.020
This should go without saying...

05:02.020 --> 05:05.260
You don't have to tell everyone
what happened today.

05:05.260 --> 05:07.520
Huh? Is that the best you can come up with?

05:07.890 --> 05:10.700
Shouldn't it be more like "Please don't
tell everyone!" or something?

05:10.700 --> 05:15.170
Are you kidding me? That sounds
like I am asking you a favor!

05:15.870 --> 05:17.330
Isn't that what you are doing?

05:19.040 --> 05:21.680
You couldn't possibly be thinking that I would have some sort of crush on Yoshiyuki-chama

05:23.820 --> 05:25.580
and hiding it?!

05:26.740 --> 05:30.480
You couldn't be further from the
truth! Don't get me wrong.

05:32.450 --> 05:34.950
Whattaya talkin' about? Your orange
heart was totally showing.

05:35.320 --> 05:37.990
Ah! But we should at least tell Vanilla about it, right?

05:38.590 --> 05:39.490
Never!

05:39.990 --> 05:43.530
Poor darling Vanilla is so sweet and kind, she'd
undoubtably worry herself sick over it!

05:43.530 --> 05:44.820
So it must be a secret!

05:45.330 --> 05:46.230
Gotcha.

05:46.900 --> 05:49.100
So it's okay with me because I'm not sweet n' kind.

05:50.270 --> 05:54.170
So! So! Let's hurry up and get
home so I can make dinner!

05:54.170 --> 05:55.330
Yeah, right.

06:00.040 --> 06:01.480
What a lovely smile...

06:02.650 --> 06:05.320
But, it looked so lonely.

06:06.520 --> 06:08.790
What's troubling you, Yoshiyuki-chama?

06:13.290 --> 06:16.520
Okay everyone! Please eat it while its still hot!

06:17.200 --> 06:21.370
More cheese again? You're really getting into this.

06:21.370 --> 06:24.640
Cheese is great n' all, but I wanna eat a little variety.

06:24.640 --> 06:25.650
Agreed.

06:25.870 --> 06:28.910
But my cheese dishes are exceptionally tasty, right?

06:30.040 --> 06:31.070
Y...yeah.

06:31.480 --> 06:33.710
We could eat them everyday, right?!

06:33.710 --> 06:35.610
Everyday's a little much...

06:35.610 --> 06:41.790
Yes! If we eat cheese everyday, then that means
I will have to go to the cheese store everyday!

06:42.590 --> 06:46.460
Which means I can see Yoshiyuki-chama
everyday, too, doesn't it?!

06:49.430 --> 06:52.530
Chocolat, what's the meaning behind all this?
Wanting to go to the cheese store all the time.

06:53.060 --> 06:57.300
Uh! Uhm! Well, she is a rat after all, aren't
rats into that sorta cheese-a-holic thing?

06:57.740 --> 07:00.200
I mean, aren't they supposed to like cheese?

07:00.200 --> 07:01.810
Oh I see!

07:01.810 --> 07:03.300
Oh yes, Chocolat!

07:03.710 --> 07:06.780
Read my fortune and see whether I will
get to see Yoshiyuki-chama everyday.

07:06.780 --> 07:07.850
I mean–

07:07.850 --> 07:12.020
If I can go buy yummy cheese everyday!

07:12.020 --> 07:14.750
Blanca! Why do you talk down to me like that?!

07:15.020 --> 07:18.620
Be honest and say "Could you please
tell me how my love will go?"

07:18.620 --> 07:21.860
Good grief, Chocolat has such a small heart.

07:22.260 --> 07:24.760
Those sorts of qualities are not
befitting a future queen.

07:25.730 --> 07:26.630
I'll whup your butt!

07:27.670 --> 07:29.070
What's wrong, Chocolat-chan?

07:29.400 --> 07:30.270
You're shaking.

07:31.370 --> 07:35.710
I can't do it. I promised to keep Blancas
secret from everyone else.

07:36.210 --> 07:37.640
S'nothing, nothing!

07:38.080 --> 07:40.740
Hey, Fortune-Telling Book! Get over here!

07:44.620 --> 07:47.450
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Rune!

07:51.060 --> 07:53.760
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Rune!

07:55.030 --> 07:57.430
Divination Livre!

08:00.060 --> 08:04.970
Tell us what is to become of Blanca going
to the delicious cheese store all the time.

08:13.580 --> 08:15.280
A Deep Foggy Labyrinth!

08:15.680 --> 08:17.750
I don't like the sound of that.

08:17.750 --> 08:21.390
The meaning behind this card is that
things are fogged up

08:21.390 --> 08:24.660
and you cannot see what is around you, much like in a labyrinth.

08:24.660 --> 08:26.220
I don't wanna hear it!

08:27.120 --> 08:31.460
Blanca, is it so unbearable to think
that you cannot eat cheese?

08:32.500 --> 08:35.700
Vanilla-chama...uhm...I...

08:36.070 --> 08:38.700
If you want cheese, I can go buy some for you.

08:39.100 --> 08:41.710
Blanca, don't worry about it.

08:43.610 --> 08:49.650
Of course! If "buying" cheese is in the fog,
I'll work at the store part-time instead!

08:49.650 --> 08:50.210
Eh?!

08:50.210 --> 08:50.880
Part-time job?!

08:50.880 --> 08:51.920
Are you serious?

08:52.220 --> 08:54.180
Serious, serious, of course I'm serious!

08:54.520 --> 09:00.060
Uh, waitasec. Doesn't that mean it's even LESS
likely we'll be eating things other than cheese?!

09:00.060 --> 09:01.060
Precisely!

09:06.860 --> 09:08.670
What's wrong, cutie-pie?

09:09.630 --> 09:10.330
Robin.

09:12.340 --> 09:15.610
Hey, I got somethin' to ask you. Okay?

09:16.210 --> 09:18.140
If it's something I can answer.

09:19.210 --> 09:20.010
You see...

09:20.710 --> 09:21.200
Hmm?

09:22.080 --> 09:26.480
What exactly was Blanca doing before
she became Vanillas familiar?

09:28.650 --> 09:34.260
I don't know the details, but maybe
she was a witch like the two of you.

09:35.330 --> 09:36.060
A witch?

09:39.800 --> 09:45.840
So, what would happen if she
fell in love with a human?

09:45.840 --> 09:47.370
The way she is now?

09:48.710 --> 09:53.780
A mouse falling in love with a human
is an impossible situation.

09:54.850 --> 09:57.250
Why would you ask such a thing?

09:59.020 --> 10:01.890
No reason! Don't worry about it!

10:02.450 --> 10:03.540
Thanks, Robin!

10:04.260 --> 10:05.060
G'night!

10:06.890 --> 10:09.290
Good night, sweet dreams.

10:25.380 --> 10:27.020
Welcome-chu!

10:28.010 --> 10:28.980
"Chu?"

10:28.980 --> 10:30.280
Busy busy busy!

10:30.280 --> 10:32.280
That girl talks like a mouse.

10:32.620 --> 10:34.190
You hired her?

10:34.190 --> 10:38.390
Well, she insisted that I hire her...

10:39.120 --> 10:40.890
So busy busy busy!

10:41.830 --> 10:44.230
I wonder if this part-time job will be okay...

10:45.230 --> 10:49.030
What's my problem?! Like I'd worry
about that bratty Blanca!

10:50.430 --> 10:53.130
Today's recommendation is Gruyere cheese!

10:53.130 --> 10:55.370
It's super-tasty for cooking with!

10:56.470 --> 10:57.470
What a peculiar girl!

10:57.880 --> 11:00.140
200 grams of cream cheese, please.

11:00.140 --> 11:01.140
Okay!

11:01.550 --> 11:03.680
200 grams of cream cheese!

11:04.720 --> 11:08.350
That's Roquefort. Cream cheese is right next to it.

11:08.350 --> 11:10.450
Oh! Of course! My mistake.

11:13.790 --> 11:15.960
I just heard something like a cats voice...

11:21.900 --> 11:26.700
I...it's the latest fashion! Mouse ears!

11:26.700 --> 11:28.070
Will she be okay?

11:33.940 --> 11:35.350
Uhm...here.

11:36.050 --> 11:38.350
A token of apology for making a scene.

11:39.820 --> 11:40.580
Thank you.

11:43.490 --> 11:44.320
Uh...

11:43.920 --> 11:44.320
Yes!?

11:45.290 --> 11:47.010
You really don't like cats, huh?

11:47.730 --> 11:49.930
I wish you had told me.

11:50.290 --> 11:52.300
Sorry about that.

11:52.760 --> 11:55.370
That cat sometimes comes around.

11:56.100 --> 11:59.300
Since mice tend to really like my store.

12:00.340 --> 12:04.810
Uhm, could it be that you hate mice?

12:07.650 --> 12:09.540
It's not that I hate them, but...

12:09.750 --> 12:11.150
You don't, do you?!

12:11.150 --> 12:13.380
Mice are really cute, aren't they?!

12:13.380 --> 12:16.420
Well, uh...I guess...

12:16.950 --> 12:20.300
I knew it! Yoshiyuki-chama
really loves mice after all!

12:20.960 --> 12:22.720
No, not exactly...

12:23.330 --> 12:26.630
But, but! There's a chance that you might
grow to LOVE mice, isn't there?

12:27.130 --> 12:29.460
Ah, y...yes, there is...

12:29.460 --> 12:32.200
My! He said "love" after all!

12:32.870 --> 12:34.800
How embarrassing!

12:35.670 --> 12:37.810
No, don't exaggerate...

12:38.280 --> 12:39.040
Blanca.

12:39.380 --> 12:40.810
She looks so happy somehow.

12:42.910 --> 12:45.080
She seriously loves this guy.

12:46.520 --> 12:51.990
And so then! It was as though Yoshiyuki-chama
was nearly admitting his love for me!

12:53.020 --> 12:56.380
But really. You practically cornered him
into saying mice are cute.

12:56.380 --> 12:59.960
It's not like he's saying he loves you, Blanca.

13:00.400 --> 13:01.770
Tsk tsk tsk!

13:01.770 --> 13:05.570
Not saying things clearly is the
attractive aspect of adult men!

13:05.570 --> 13:08.610
Not that I would expect a kid like you to understand!

13:10.470 --> 13:13.780
You're delusional. S'not worth my worry.

13:14.110 --> 13:17.650
Worried? What would you need to worry about?

13:18.120 --> 13:19.680
No, nothing.

13:21.090 --> 13:24.280
Chocolat, are you jealous that I managed
to snag a date with Yoshiyuki-chama–

13:24.280 --> 13:25.120
Er, I mean–

13:25.460 --> 13:30.130
That Yoshiyuki-chama insisted
that he take me out to a movie?

13:30.130 --> 13:32.080
What's that?! You never told me!

13:32.600 --> 13:37.070
Well be going to a new movie called "Cats and
Rats," featuring rats that beat the pulp outta cats!

13:37.400 --> 13:40.040
Wow, impressive work, Blanca!

13:43.510 --> 13:45.440
Lemme take a peek in here...

13:47.210 --> 13:50.450
Ah, this looks like it would suit me nicely.

13:50.450 --> 13:52.890
Chocolat, let me borrow this ribbon!

13:53.180 --> 13:56.140
Eh?! Aw, c'mon! That's my favorite!

13:56.450 --> 13:58.690
Ooh, and these earrings, too!

13:58.690 --> 13:59.520
Waitasec!

14:00.260 --> 14:02.630
And this ring...

14:00.620 --> 14:03.060
They're friendly all of a sudden.

14:03.460 --> 14:04.930
What's going on here?

14:09.030 --> 14:10.030
How's it look?

14:11.270 --> 14:13.640
Are you really gonna go on a date like that?

14:14.210 --> 14:18.830
Don't get huffy. I can't help it if
your things look better on me!

14:19.540 --> 14:21.280
Gimme a break.

14:21.280 --> 14:23.350
Just what are you trying to do?

14:24.280 --> 14:26.520
That is none of your business!

14:26.520 --> 14:28.080
Ah! I got it!

14:28.390 --> 14:31.820
Are you trying to dress weird
to make Vanilla look better?

14:33.660 --> 14:36.230
Well, off I go, or I'll be late!

14:40.230 --> 14:42.770
That movie was so much fun!

14:42.770 --> 14:43.730
Wasn't it?

14:46.070 --> 14:48.440
He always looks so sad...

14:49.210 --> 14:52.380
I know of an adorable cafe around here!

14:52.380 --> 14:53.440
Why don't we go there?

14:56.510 --> 14:59.680
Yoshiyuki-chama, why do you like cheese so much?

15:00.450 --> 15:01.990
Why, indeed...

15:03.790 --> 15:05.690
Again with such sad eyes.

15:06.860 --> 15:08.690
Yoshiyuki-chama...

15:09.630 --> 15:12.700
Why do you always look so sad when I see you?

15:13.800 --> 15:14.700
Me?

15:15.500 --> 15:21.400
If you don't mind, I want you to tell me
what's weighing so heavily on your heart.

15:22.670 --> 15:24.710
Thank you, Blanca.

15:25.640 --> 15:28.710
You've been worried about me.

15:29.580 --> 15:32.620
I'm sorry. I still can't talk about it.

15:34.960 --> 15:36.250
I see...

15:42.190 --> 15:46.230
Yoshiyuki-chama's heart is full of something.

15:47.030 --> 15:50.400
And whatever that something is,
it's weighing him down heavily.

15:51.570 --> 15:52.930
Blanca!

15:53.440 --> 15:54.940
So how'd the date go?

15:55.470 --> 15:58.980
O-of course Yoshiyuki-chama and I whispered sweet nothings to each other the whole time!

15:59.540 --> 16:04.280
It's a kind of love that a kid like
you would never understand!

16:04.280 --> 16:05.680
Liar!

16:06.380 --> 16:07.580
I'm not lying!

16:08.250 --> 16:14.590
I'm not hiding the fact that Yoshiyuki-chama
is always so sad-looking!

16:15.390 --> 16:16.730
Sad-looking?

16:18.460 --> 16:22.230
Chocolat, the truth is, I need your help.

16:23.770 --> 16:28.370
I'll go see what is making Yoshiyuki-chama so sad.

16:29.040 --> 16:31.310
You sure? Me coming with you, I mean.

16:32.340 --> 16:34.510
I'm scared to do it myself.

16:36.910 --> 16:40.680
Please show us what will bring the smile
back to Yoshiyuki-chama's face!

16:43.050 --> 16:46.230
This is...Yoshiyuki-chama's room?

16:47.830 --> 16:48.660
That letter!

16:49.230 --> 16:51.630
I sometimes see Yoshiyuki-chama reading it!

16:51.960 --> 16:52.860
And that's...

16:53.560 --> 16:55.400
That picture...

17:03.810 --> 17:04.640
Yoshiyuki...

17:05.510 --> 17:08.950
I'm sorry for being so selfish
and going to Paris to study.

17:09.580 --> 17:12.880
My feelings towards you have never changed.

17:13.250 --> 17:15.120
I still do love you.

17:17.690 --> 17:18.620
Blanca...

17:20.390 --> 17:21.920
I've decided!

17:22.330 --> 17:23.460
Eh? What?

17:23.460 --> 17:27.430
We've got to have Yoshiyuki-chama
meet up with his lover in France.

17:29.670 --> 17:34.440
I don't want to see Yoshiyuki-chama's
sad face anymore.

17:35.270 --> 17:37.370
But, if we do that...

17:37.370 --> 17:38.410
It's okay!

17:38.940 --> 17:41.540
I'm definitely a better woman, so...

17:41.950 --> 17:47.280
...once he gets his feelings all straightened
out, hell definitely come back to me.

17:47.280 --> 17:48.280
Blanca...

17:48.590 --> 17:51.620
Well, what are we waiting around here for? Let's go!

17:51.620 --> 17:52.960
Let's get going!

17:52.960 --> 17:54.520
Eh? I'm going too?

17:54.830 --> 17:58.590
Even if it's only you, it's much
better than going it alone!

17:59.200 --> 18:05.040
Why can't you just come out with it and
say you'd be lonely without me there?!

18:05.040 --> 18:07.910
Chocolat! Hurry up and get moving!

18:07.910 --> 18:09.040
Yeah, yeah.

18:12.480 --> 18:15.240
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Rune!

18:17.950 --> 18:20.150
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Rune!

18:29.660 --> 18:32.960
Huh? This is...

18:36.200 --> 18:37.720
What a thick fog.

18:45.210 --> 18:46.440
Yoshiyuki.

18:48.150 --> 18:49.180
Mizue.

18:49.580 --> 18:50.180
Mizue!

18:54.450 --> 18:57.790
What happened? Why are you here?

18:59.060 --> 19:00.560
I wanted to see you so badly!

19:01.960 --> 19:03.160
Is this a dream?

19:04.160 --> 19:04.760
A dream?

19:06.760 --> 19:11.130
That's right. There's no way you could've come here.

19:11.840 --> 19:12.900
It must be a dream.

19:14.040 --> 19:15.070
It doesn't matter if its a dream.

19:15.910 --> 19:18.140
Because I really do love you.

19:19.080 --> 19:20.640
Being away from you, now I'm sure.

19:22.610 --> 19:24.880
When you return, let's get married.

19:26.020 --> 19:27.350
I'll be waiting for you, always.

19:33.020 --> 19:33.760
Blanca.

19:35.290 --> 19:36.130
You okay?

19:36.590 --> 19:37.790
I'm okay.

19:38.460 --> 19:43.820
But my heart is in pain. The strength
of my magic is starting to fade.

19:46.240 --> 19:47.600
Yoshiyuki?

19:53.310 --> 19:55.650
What happened, just now?

20:01.650 --> 20:02.690
Hello?

20:03.050 --> 20:04.680
Mizue?!

20:05.060 --> 20:06.990
Hello? Yoshiyuki?

20:07.790 --> 20:12.190
I think I just saw you in a dream.

20:13.030 --> 20:17.070
Does that sound strange? Saying such things...

20:18.040 --> 20:19.470
That's not strange at all.

20:20.140 --> 20:23.340
I saw the same dream myself.

20:26.640 --> 20:27.940
Yoshiyuki-chama.

20:32.680 --> 20:33.220
Check it out.

20:33.780 --> 20:34.650
He's smilin'.

20:38.560 --> 20:40.960
So that's Yoshiyuki-chama's smile!

20:41.790 --> 20:44.690
I've wanted to see it for so long!

20:45.530 --> 20:46.890
But...

20:47.800 --> 20:51.670
But that smile isn't for me.

20:52.940 --> 20:53.730
Blanca.

20:54.000 --> 20:56.140
S'okay. I'm okay!

20:56.140 --> 20:59.010
It wasn't real love or anything like that!

20:59.840 --> 21:00.810
You aren't crying?

21:01.710 --> 21:03.380
Of course I'm not crying!

21:04.010 --> 21:07.120
How could I cry over something like this?

21:08.520 --> 21:10.590
Nothing to see here! Let's get home!

21:10.990 --> 21:11.850
Yeah, yeah.

21:15.090 --> 21:18.090
Yoshiyuki-chama!

21:23.870 --> 21:27.200
Chocolat-chan! Hurry up and eat your breakfast!

21:27.200 --> 21:28.270
You'll be late!

21:29.510 --> 21:31.140
Lemme guess, cheese again?

21:31.140 --> 21:33.010
Guess again, Chocolat!

21:35.550 --> 21:36.290
PIZZA?!

21:36.610 --> 21:37.310
Why?!

21:37.850 --> 21:42.790
I don't know why, but it seems she's into pizza now.

21:43.620 --> 21:44.290
Welcome.

21:45.120 --> 21:46.960
Man, she moves on fast.

21:46.960 --> 21:48.530
What's this? Today's pizza?

21:48.530 --> 21:50.230
Whoa! Looks delicious!

21:50.230 --> 21:52.820
From now on we'll have pizza every day!

21:53.830 --> 21:54.530
Every day?!

21:54.530 --> 21:56.830
- Again?!
- No way!

21:57.270 --> 21:59.740
Now, now! You better start eating!

22:00.070 --> 22:03.310
While you all are eating, I'm going to
stop by again for the second round!

22:04.470 --> 22:05.910
Wait a minute!

22:05.910 --> 22:08.650
You don't have to go everyday!

22:08.650 --> 22:09.980
Wait!

22:10.980 --> 22:13.120
Don't worry about it!

22:23.120 --> 22:29.450
I light a red candle, and whisper:

22:29.540 --> 22:30.950
"Love"

22:31.860 --> 22:35.370
A magic spell.

22:37.500 --> 22:44.780
With you, there's nothing to be afraid of... probably.

22:46.210 --> 22:54.280
Please hold me. Where am I going?

22:55.960 --> 23:00.230
Take me along, take me along,

23:00.830 --> 23:03.890
To the world beyond the moon.

23:04.200 --> 23:11.270
It doesn't matter if everyone stops.

23:12.640 --> 23:16.080
To the world beyond the moon.

23:18.080 --> 23:26.190
I'll be waiting in the real world.

23:26.250 --> 23:35.160
The eternal world of which you spoke.

23:47.650 --> 23:49.610
Hey! Don't you guys wanna become witches?

23:50.230 --> 23:51.450
You wanna, don'tcha?

23:51.830 --> 23:55.810
I've been a witch since birth, so I guess I'm kinda lucky in that way.

23:56.640 --> 23:59.700
Okay, if you really wanna be one, right this way!

24:00.470 --> 24:04.420
If you wanna know my magic tricks,
I'll be happy! To! Share!

24:05.040 --> 24:07.120
Next time on Sugar Sugar Rune:

24:07.120 --> 24:09.880
Chocolat's Pinch? A Cute Witch Volunteer

24:10.730 --> 24:12.760
You better watch, or I'll whup your butt!

24:12.760 --> 24:13.710
Thanks!
